N('Hangi cümle doğru? (şimdiki özellik, geçmiş sonuç)','If I were braver, I would have asked her out.','Şimdiki durum + geçmiş sonuç.',{'If I was braver, I will have asked her out.':'will have bu yapıda olmaz.','If I had been braver, I would ask her out yesterday.':'yesterday geçmiş sonuç ister.'}),
